        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ICsLd2RBmoRyxcxTscYlam3ygfd\"><em><strong>The chart below shows the amount of money given to developing countries from five organizations from 2008 to 2011. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Aid to Developing Countries: 2008&ndash;2011</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BLz0dKYztoP7SaxvaB5luUzdg5i\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Aid to Developing Countries: 2008&ndash;2011 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về lượng tiền quy&ecirc;n g&oacute;p cho c&aacute;c quốc gia đang ph&aacute;t triển của năm tổ chức kh&aacute;c nhau từ năm 2008 đến 2011</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HDA8dO8YPo72qRxdy0PlAWJDgub\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLJCdRFJuoacxpxFYTxl0f1mgi2\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Aid to Developing Countries: 2008&ndash;2011 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: lượng tiền quy&ecirc;n g&oacute;p - quốc gia đang ph&aacute;t triển - năm tổ chức kh&aacute;c nhau - giai đoạn 4 năm từ 2008 đến 2011.</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HBJLdorasotac9xk723lTjoAg9g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WX6Hd7eA8odriFxhJAKlIfzzgKd\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WX6Hd7eA8odriFxhJAKlIfzzgKd\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WX6Hd7eA8odriFxhJAKlIfzzgKd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpRdd0PHvovauTxdnrglEhUugAh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: trong khi </strong>organization 2 <strong>tăng ổn định</strong>, organization 1 v&agrave; organization 3 tăng rồi giảm, v&agrave; organization 4 v&agrave; 5 c&oacute; <strong>xu hướng giảm</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MxcHdWin3oFkU8xlzKblp07zgoY\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>organization 2 quy&ecirc;n g&oacute;p lượng tiền nhiều nhất v&agrave; tăng nhiều nhất xuy&ecirc;n suốt giai đoạn</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;n</strong><strong>g</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QPupd9dAKoYTNFxldOBltjf9gNe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Organization 2 v&agrave; 3</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXsNdn75AoOlOQxHUd5lezFEgPb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jl2rdpeLAozr7dx7yeulpAp5gVb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2008 </strong><em>(organization 3 cung cấp 1.5 tỷ đ&ocirc;, organization 2 đ&oacute;ng g&oacute;p 1.3 tỷ đ&ocirc;)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwaQd5tIEo7DXLx8bR1lzMs1gNc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của organization 2 </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng đều</strong></em><em>, đạt 2.6 tỷ đ&ocirc; v&agrave;o 2011)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-In4PdYmsUonrD9xeQprlD4yVgYg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của organization 3 </strong><em>(tăng đạt gần 1.8 tỷ đ&ocirc; v&agrave;o 2009 trước khi giảm xuống 1.5 tỷ đ&ocirc; v&agrave;o 2011)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0NzdDnZ1oJ5Wlx8OLvlsfXRgTc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Organization 1, 4, v&agrave; 5</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VTIgdWTG0ow90TxuoajlmlONgIg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L5RmdNPvsosuxjxbj0klggh4g5b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2008 </strong><em>(organization 5 khởi đầu với mức 1.2 tỷ đ&ocirc;, trong khi organization 1 v&agrave; 4 ở mức 0.7 tỷ đ&ocirc;)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XDNsddsC6o5GxYxGaRqlBAXvgYp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của organization 1 </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng nhẹ</strong></em><em> đạt 0.7 tỷ độ v&agrave;o năm 2011)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WbfsdKLPkoSms0x1WDRlk41mgnc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của organization 4 v&agrave; 5 </strong><em>(organization 4 giảm xuống 0.4, c&ograve;n organization 5 giảm xuống 0.5 tỷ đ&ocirc;, </em><em><strong>theo thứ tự đ&oacute;</strong></em><em> v&agrave;o năm 2011)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tw5QdMsmgo3Bf8xkcK5lDu6OgZo\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasin</strong><strong>g</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6Q5dNsjTogsZxxKU2qlf4WmgLb\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2MCdvXR5oooHCxOvw2lEnlngwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YYwxdNB3wo0hjlxvlWhlXI3ogTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BGeVd4cThooCTmxtB26l7HsugBN\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Khi muốn diễn đạt <strong>\"lượng tiền được quy&ecirc;n g&oacute;p\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"the amount of money given\"</strong>, th&igrave; m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng cụm từ <strong>\"the financial aid\" - \"cứu trợ t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh\" </strong>để c&acirc;u văn đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XZ8RdYAMpoNCjuxlPvbl9w0ggIb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FoCWdMHIVo9zlSxE8i6lhaZtgob\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The bar chart illustrates <strong>the financial aid</strong> provided to developing nations by five different organizations over a four-year period from 2008 to 2011.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QWm6dHvxwoiymJxdyeUl42Jngmh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q0Mjdo3pWo7DyaxtJOYlGXnSgVg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Ngo&agrave;i ra để thay thế cho c&aacute;c <strong>\"organization\"</strong> trong b&agrave;i m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng từ <strong>\"donors\"</strong> - <strong>\"nh&agrave; quy&ecirc;n g&oacute;p\"</strong> bạn nh&eacute;</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuA1dYJ2Xofh6hxnXoFljyh3gOg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuA1dYJ2Xofh6hxnXoFljyh3gOg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Looking at the major donors, ...</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
